chezmoi dots status — Dotfiles repository and apply status

USAGE
  chezmoi dots status [options]

ARGUMENTS
  None. Shows the dotfiles git checkout (branch, ahead/behind, local changes) and what chezmoi apply would change. No network access unless --fetch.

OPTIONS
  -h, --help  Show this help and exit successfully.
  --check  exit non-zero when the dotfiles are not in sync (default: "false")
  --fetch  git fetch the dotfiles first (default: "false")

ENVIRONMENT
  CHEZMOI_EXECUTABLE  chezmoi executable (default: chezmoi).
  CHEZMOI_CONFIG_FILE  chezmoi config file (default: chezmoi's config).
  CHEZMOI_SOURCE_DIR  source directory (default: ask chezmoi; honors .chezmoiroot).
  CHEZMOI_WORKING_TREE  dotfiles working tree (default: ask chezmoi).

EXAMPLES
  chezmoi dots status
  chezmoi dots status --fetch --check
